    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Flight 737 - MAXIMUM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>This game is designed for those who do not want to fly a plane and deal with many complicated procedures, but want to be able to control everything in a simplified way.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easily Use the 737 Passenger Aircraft and Feel Like a Pilot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Total 5 Continents and 50 Different Airports</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Autopilot feature with detailed controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Functional Co-Pilot support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flight plan and checklist that changes for each flight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FMC, Fuel data, ICAO, Leg Vectors, Flight number, Heading, IAS/Mach and Vertical Speed \u200b\u200bdetails</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Detailed lighting options inside and outside the cockpit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wireless frequency and radio usage, communication with the tower, ground services and flight crew. Refueling, De-icing, Pushback Operations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Passenger and Cargo Transportation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cabin Pressure, ALIGN and IRS Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigation System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic Audio and Visual Alerts for the Aircraft</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fun Flight Physics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic Preparation, Taxiing, Takeoff, Cruise and Landing Scenario</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ability to Set Flight Duration, Weather Conditions and Your Own Crash Simulation if You Want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ability to Land from Any Airport to Any Airport</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Active Air Traffic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Post-Landing Procedures and the Task of Parking the Aircraft Correctly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design Your Own Aircraft Image and Use It in the Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Realistic and Full Flight Controller Support</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Supports Many Gamepads in Addition to Keyboard and Mouse. Also Provides Full Support for Logitech Extreme 3D and Thrustmaster TCA Airbus Edition Controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Fun Not Limited to Passenger Aircraft</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Game Offers Realistic Helicopter and Different Missions. There is also Retro Jet Fighter (Advanced) Fighter plane game and Forklift Operator Missions as Ground Services.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Flight 737 - MAXIMUM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>This game is designed for those who do not want to fly a plane and deal with many complicated procedures, but want to be able to control everything in a simplified way.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easily Use the 737 Passenger Aircraft and Feel Like a Pilot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Total 5 Continents and 50 Different Airports</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Autopilot feature with detailed controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Functional Co-Pilot support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flight plan and checklist that changes for each flight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FMC, Fuel data, ICAO, Leg Vectors, Flight number, Heading, IAS/Mach and Vertical Speed \u200b\u200bdetails</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Detailed lighting options inside and outside the cockpit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wireless frequency and radio usage, communication with the tower, ground services and flight crew. Refueling, De-icing, Pushback Operations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Passenger and Cargo Transportation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cabin Pressure, ALIGN and IRS Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigation System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic Audio and Visual Alerts for the Aircraft</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fun Flight Physics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic Preparation, Taxiing, Takeoff, Cruise and Landing Scenario</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ability to Set Flight Duration, Weather Conditions and Your Own Crash Simulation if You Want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ability to Land from Any Airport to Any Airport</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Active Air Traffic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Post-Landing Procedures and the Task of Parking the Aircraft Correctly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design Your Own Aircraft Image and Use It in the Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Realistic and Full Flight Controller Support</u></strong></p><p